  {
    "messageType": "SlotOperationCommand",
    "pointer": "/payload/operationType",
    "keywords": ["enum"],
    "value": "UNLOAD",
    "disposition": "companion",
    "set": {
      "/correlationId": null,
      "/payload/expectedFinalPhysicalState": "EMPTY"
    },
    "basis": "跨字段：schema 的 allOf 规定 UNLOAD 的 correlationId 为 null（manifest 的 correlationRule 是 LOAD_REQUIRES_SUBLOT_CORRELATION_UNLOAD_NULL）；卸货的终态是 EMPTY，与下一条配对。"
  },
  {
    "messageType": "SlotOperationCommand",
    "pointer": "/payload/expectedFinalPhysicalState",
    "keywords": ["enum"],
    "value": "EMPTY",
    "disposition": "companion",
    "set": {
      "/payload/operationType": "UNLOAD",
      "/correlationId": null
    },
    "basis": "跨字段：终态 EMPTY 属于 UNLOAD、OCCUPIED 属于 LOAD，schema 只各自列两个枚举，写不出配对；装货必带 correlationId、卸货必为 null。"
  }
